r, and DPS roles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep gear system with tiers, rarities, and a Collection Log</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >185-node skill tree with game-changing keystones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless endgame with infinitely scaling difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboards: Gear Score, Total Level, Dungeons Cleared, Top Hero per class, and Endless depth</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend. Gear up. Go deeper.<br><br>I can't wait to release this game, it is honestly super fun!</p>", "short_description": "Assemble a party of heroes, descend into a living 3D dungeon, and watch them fight. A deep idle RPG with TONS of ENDLESS Content!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4243240/fd27a249f33a4d8851fc91a6c6cfd01bb76d7d94/header.jpg?t=1787417485", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4243240/daaa1b2a93aab65c56035ddb164459ba76f38995/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787417485", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4243240/daaa1b2a93aab65c56035ddb164459ba76f38995/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787417485", "website": "https://discord.gg/Pg3ZUgY57x", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 / Windows 8 / Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent (any dual-core)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2,048 MB MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics (Intel HD 4000 or better)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1,000 MB MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Standard onboard audio<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Runs on 